# Secrets — never commit private keys or certificates. The mTLS
# certificate issued for AppsInToss server-to-server APIs (Toss
# 로그인 / 토스 페이 / IAP / 푸시 / 프로모션 — needed for v2
# cash reward) lives outside the repo by design. These patterns
# are a safety net in case a cert ever gets dragged in by accident.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
mTLS_인증서*/
secrets/
